{
  "tema": 7079,
  "slug": "infinitivo-sujeto-objeto",
  "titulo": "The infinitive as subject or object",
  "subtitulo": "«Nadar es bueno. Me gusta surfear.»",
  "foto": "t02.jpg",
  "regla": "When a verb works like a noun (as the subject or the object of another verb), Spanish uses the infinitive, never the gerund: nadar es bueno, me gusta surfear. English _swimming_ is Spanish **nadar**.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In English, the **-ing** form can act as a noun: _**Swimming** is good_, _I love **reading**_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Spanish never does this with the gerund (**-ando / -iendo**). It uses the **infinitive** (**-ar / -er / -ir**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Job in the sentence",
            "English",
            "Spanish"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "subject",
              "_Running_ is healthy.",
              "**Correr** es sano."
            ],
            [
              "object of gustar & co.",
              "_I like surfing._",
              "Me gusta **surfear**."
            ],
            [
              "after ser / es",
              "_The hard part is waking up._",
              "Lo difícil es **despertarse**."
            ],
            [
              "signs and rules",
              "_No smoking._",
              "Prohibido **fumar**."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "An infinitive subject takes a **singular** verb: **Correr es sano**, **Me gusta bailar**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Sometimes you'll see **el** before it (**el fumar**), but at this level just use the bare infinitive."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The gerund is for actions in progress (**estoy nadando**), not for naming an activity."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
